{"3956400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mr. Talkie's Redacted Reels", "steam_appid": 3956400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/729995d151052f719dbce2388ed175e2.avif?t=1756623952\" width=1560 height=536 /></span><strong>Good evening fine fellows... My name is [REDACTED], but you can call me Mr. Talkie.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Tonight, you're in for quite the treat!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">What I have for you are <strong>nine reels</strong> never before seen... Well, by human eyes, at least.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A rather fine assortment of <strong>pain and suffering</strong>, if I do say so myself!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/df9b107256608c3381b5568e1a4a8f80.avif?t=1756623952\" width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/e7f0eb4281bd1af30d5eec62b1d8f83a.poster.avif?t=1756623952\" width=780 height=439 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/e7f0eb4281bd1af30d5eec62b1d8f83a.webm?t=1756623952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/9b5fd22e8789234486246bde31c93eb4.avif?t=1756623952\" width=800 height=219 /></span></p><p class=