tatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/4676e3de3ff45c762c3466023bbec692.avif?t=1756623952\" width=800 height=291 /></span>UNKNOWN CONNECTION <br>Being a radio astronomer is usually boring... but today, your job is quite exceptional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/77e815e810fa12b0b1a5785b6ede68e2.webp?t=1756623952\" width=783 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/3459a25345b198622e341c80ca0931b1.avif?t=1756623952\" width=800 height=291 /></span>ANTLER <br>Your little boy goes missing in the woods behind your home after having nightmares. It's up to you to find him, before something else does...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/77e815e810fa12b0b1a5785b6ede68e2.webp?t=1756623952\" width=783 height=16 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/25fa2fab84624722dfc19ea926135454.avif?t=1756623952\" width=800 height=291 /></span>EL MASMELO  <br>Who doesn't love roasting marshmallows? Well... your child isn't very amused by them, and runs off...  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/77e815e810fa12b0b1a5785b6ede68e2.webp?t=1756623952\" width=783 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3956400/extras/1e0a9912e4b272785a6b568779576454.avif?t=1756623952\" width=800 height=291 /></span>HULDUFÓLK 